WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.133
-Five conservative justices
on the Supreme Court

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:06.167
are apparently poised
to overturn Roe v. Wade

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:09.334
and erase women's constitutional
right to bodily autonomy,

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:12.701
subverting the will of
the vast majority of Americans

00:00:12.701 --> 00:00:15.100
and defying a half century
of legal precedent.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.634
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:19.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:23.834
As everyone undoubtedly
knows by now,

00:00:23.834 --> 00:00:25.667
five Republicans
on the Supreme Court

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:28.300
appear poised to strike down
Roe v. Wade

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.868
and erase abortion rights,
in a ruling that would deprive

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:33.667
tens of millions of women
their fundamental right

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.501
to make healthcare decisions
for themselves.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.834
We know that from
a truly stunning leak

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:39.067
of a draft opinion.

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:41.400
And while there
have been leaks before,

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.234
a leak of this magnitude
seems virtually unprecedented

00:00:44.234 --> 00:00:45.701
in the history of the court.

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:48.033
-It is cataclysmic, I think,
for the reputation of the court

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:51.200
and even for the internal
operations of the court.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.767
This is how they do their work.
They do it in secrecy.

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:57.801
I cannot think of another time
where a full draft opinion

00:00:57.801 --> 00:01:00.300
has leaked early
in the process like this.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:03.868
You cannot understate --
overstate how big a deal this is

00:01:03.868 --> 00:01:05.300
for how the court operates.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:06.767
The trust is shattered.

00:01:06.767 --> 00:01:08.234
And I think it's going
to take a long time

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.167
for the court
to recover from this.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:12.834
-Oh, I'm sorry to hear that
their trust has been shattered.

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:14.767
How will they ever recover
from this breach

00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:16.133
of their personal privacy?

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:19.167
Maybe Samuel Alito can start
wearing a shirt that says,

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:21.701
"My judicial body, my choice."

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:26.467
We never get -- we never get
this sort of inside look.

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:28.267
We never get this sort
of inside look

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:30.067
at the private machinations
of the court.

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:31.467
It's a secretive institution

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:33.267
of unaccountable
lifetime appointees.

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:36.234
They don't want you to know what
they're up to behind the scenes,

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:37.734
especially in a case like this.

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:39.934
Seeing one of their draft
opinions before it's published

00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:42.801
is like seeing your gym teacher
in a liquor store,

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:45.200
or like seeing
a Taco Bell employee

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.534
lead a horse into the kitchen.

00:01:46.534 --> 00:01:47.868
"Whoa, whoa!

00:01:47.868 --> 00:01:50.901
Whoa! Steady, Chalupa!
It's gonna be fine."

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:52.567
And you know what?

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:55.534
Maybe the institution deserves
to be shattered a little bit.

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:57.534
You could argue
it was already shattered

00:01:57.534 --> 00:01:59.400
a long time ago
by cynical Republicans

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.934
who spent decades turning it
into a political weapon

00:02:01.934 --> 00:02:04.601
by defiling the Constitution,
stealing Supreme Court seats,

00:02:04.601 --> 00:02:06.667
and forcing their nominees
onto the bench

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:08.067
through the exercise
of raw power.

00:02:08.067 --> 00:02:09.334
Remember when Lindsey Graham

00:02:09.334 --> 00:02:11.801
went on an unhinged
partisan screed

00:02:11.801 --> 00:02:13.868
to get the "I like beer" guy
on the court?

00:02:13.868 --> 00:02:15.601
I mean, look at his face.

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:17.434
Does this look like
the face of a guy

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:20.000
who cares about the integrity
of our institutions?

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.167
He looks like he's auditioning
to play the villain

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:23.767
in a Tennessee Williams play.

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:25.467
[ As Graham ]
Meemaw, I swear by God,

00:02:25.467 --> 00:02:27.467
I'll get my revenge on you
for telling me

00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:29.300
I'll never make it out
of this one-horse town --

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.334
No-horse town?!

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:33.000
What happened to Chalupa?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.667
He made a run for the border?!

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:37.267
[ Normal voice ] And yet
it won't surprise you to learn

00:02:37.267 --> 00:02:38.734
that even as they appear poised

00:02:38.734 --> 00:02:41.167
to shred the fundamental rights
of tens of millions of women

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:44.000
and reap their biggest
political victory in 50 years,

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.734
conservatives are still whining
and casting themselves

00:02:46.734 --> 00:02:49.434
as victims
because of the leak.

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:51.801
-There has to be
consequences, Harmeet,

00:02:51.801 --> 00:02:54.267
for this individual,
whoever it was.

00:02:54.267 --> 00:02:58.567
The Chief Justice,
it's incumbent upon him

00:02:58.567 --> 00:03:01.100
to bring every law clerk
before him --

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:02.434
"Give me your phones."

00:03:02.434 --> 00:03:04.601
I'm sorry. Or the FBI.

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:07.567
"Give me your phone.
We want all your accounts.

00:03:07.567 --> 00:03:09.334
We got to do our own...

00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:12.000
You know, we have to do
our own...

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.901
look at every device
that you've ever used

00:03:13.901 --> 00:03:15.567
and find out who did this."

00:03:15.567 --> 00:03:18.234
-I like that they just pan
over the Supreme Court justices

00:03:18.234 --> 00:03:20.200
like they're like,
"It could be you!

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.968
It could be you.
Was it you?"

00:03:22.968 --> 00:03:25.067
"The privacy of the court
has been violated,

00:03:25.067 --> 00:03:27.534
and nothing is more sacred
than privacy.

00:03:27.534 --> 00:03:30.033
So give me your phone!
We want all your accounts!

00:03:30.033 --> 00:03:32.334
Your Uber, your Pinterest,
your Seamless account.

00:03:32.334 --> 00:03:34.667
I want to know if you've been
ordering suspicious woke foods

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:37.634
like green juices
or quinoa burgers."

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:39.100
And how do you know
it's a liberal?

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.334
It could have just as easily
been a conservative --

00:03:41.334 --> 00:03:42.334
[ Coughs ]

00:03:42.334 --> 00:03:44.334
Ginni Thomas --
[ Coughs ]

00:03:44.334 --> 00:03:46.667
who leaked the opinion
to freeze the majority in place

00:03:46.667 --> 00:03:48.667
and stop the Chief Justice
John Roberts,

00:03:48.667 --> 00:03:51.234
from trying to convince one of
the other court's conservatives

00:03:51.234 --> 00:03:53.434
to soften their stance.
I have no idea.

00:03:53.434 --> 00:03:55.801
But the fact that they're all
freaking out about the leak

00:03:55.801 --> 00:03:57.868
instead of celebrating
the victory is telling.

00:03:57.868 --> 00:03:59.501
It underscores yet again

00:03:59.501 --> 00:04:01.234
that even at the height
of their powers,

00:04:01.234 --> 00:04:03.634
these people always
have to play the victim.

00:04:03.634 --> 00:04:05.934
If they won a free car
on "Wheel of Fortune,"

00:04:05.934 --> 00:04:07.534
they'd immediately
start whining,

00:04:07.534 --> 00:04:09.467
"But I already have
two cars in my garage!

00:04:09.467 --> 00:04:11.334
I don't have space
for a brand-new Stingray.

00:04:11.334 --> 00:04:13.167
This is so unfair!"

00:04:13.167 --> 00:04:15.534
And if that doesn't strike you
as an insane reaction,

00:04:15.534 --> 00:04:17.067
here's something
even more unhinged --

00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:20.400
Fox News personalities
referring to a leak

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.534
of an unclassified document
as an "insurrection."

00:04:23.534 --> 00:04:25.734
-This is an insurrection
against the court,

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:27.801
and it needs to be found
who did it,

00:04:27.801 --> 00:04:29.367
and whatever legal means

00:04:29.367 --> 00:04:31.501
can be taken against them
needs to be taken.

00:04:31.501 --> 00:04:34.434
-I am so glad that Ari
used the term insurrection.

00:04:34.434 --> 00:04:35.701
That's exactly what it is.

00:04:35.701 --> 00:04:37.934
But let's take it
one step further.

00:04:37.934 --> 00:04:42.234
This is an insurrection
not by some guy from some state

00:04:42.234 --> 00:04:44.901
who got hot under the collar
and went to D.C.

00:04:44.901 --> 00:04:46.634
and got overheated at a rally.

00:04:46.634 --> 00:04:51.167
This is insurrection by a person
who is paid for by the taxpayers

00:04:51.167 --> 00:04:55.501
and who has a duty
under his particular job

00:04:55.501 --> 00:04:57.734
and employment
to keep his mouth shut.

00:04:57.734 --> 00:04:59.200
And he didn't do it.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:03.133
So it's an egregious form,
if you will, of insurrection.

00:05:03.133 --> 00:05:05.901
And I hope that everyone
will use that term,

00:05:05.901 --> 00:05:10.767
because if what happened
January 6th was an insurrection,

00:05:10.767 --> 00:05:13.767
this absolutely
is an insurrection.

00:05:13.767 --> 00:05:15.734
-First of all,
total side note here,

00:05:15.734 --> 00:05:17.801
but what's with the beard,
Mike Huckabee?

00:05:17.801 --> 00:05:20.267
You look like
a hillbilly Santa Claus.

00:05:20.267 --> 00:05:21.934
"Ho, ho, ho!
Merry Christmas.

00:05:21.934 --> 00:05:24.267
Here's a pack of cigarettes
and a Dr. Seuss book

00:05:24.267 --> 00:05:26.934
with the racist stuff
still in there."

00:05:26.934 --> 00:05:30.033
Second, do you think you guys
might be projecting a bit

00:05:30.033 --> 00:05:31.501
with this insurrection nonsense?

00:05:31.501 --> 00:05:33.534
Leaking a document
is not an insurrection.

00:05:33.534 --> 00:05:36.100
January 6th,
when a mob of rioters

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.367
violently stormed the Capitol,
that was an insurrection.

00:05:38.367 --> 00:05:40.868
In this case, someone posted
a piece of paper online.

00:05:40.868 --> 00:05:42.968
Here, I'll prove
which one is worse.

00:05:42.968 --> 00:05:44.901
Do you think Mike Pence
would rather be whisked

00:05:44.901 --> 00:05:46.501
out of a building
by Secret Service

00:05:46.501 --> 00:05:48.901
while a mob chanted
"Hang Mike Pence"

00:05:48.901 --> 00:05:53.133
or read a leaked memo
that said "Hang Mike Pence"?

00:05:53.133 --> 00:05:55.801
Do all these pundits whining
about the leak really think

00:05:55.801 --> 00:05:58.267
this is what will shatter
the integrity of the court?

00:05:58.267 --> 00:06:00.734
Not the fact that
Republicans stole a seat

00:06:00.734 --> 00:06:03.567
from President Obama or the fact
that several of their nominees

00:06:03.567 --> 00:06:06.667
apparently lied to the Senate
about their positions on Roe,

00:06:06.667 --> 00:06:08.167
or the fact that one of them

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:10.267
called opposition
to his nomination

00:06:10.267 --> 00:06:12.334
based on credible
sexual assault allegations

00:06:12.334 --> 00:06:15.501
a smear campaign orchestrated
by shadowy left-wing groups

00:06:15.501 --> 00:06:16.501
and the Clintons?

00:06:16.501 --> 00:06:18.167
I could go on, so I will.

00:06:18.167 --> 00:06:20.200
The fact they rushed
through another nominee

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:21.868
a little over a week
before the election,

00:06:21.868 --> 00:06:24.734
a nominee whose ceremony turned
out to be a superspreader event

00:06:24.734 --> 00:06:26.400
and who posed
for a political photo op

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.167
with the president
after her confirmation,

00:06:28.167 --> 00:06:30.734
or the fact that another justice
declined to recuse himself

00:06:30.734 --> 00:06:32.701
from a case that potentially
involved text messages

00:06:32.701 --> 00:06:35.167
sent by his wife that would
reveal her involvement

00:06:35.167 --> 00:06:36.901
in attempts to overthrow
a presidential election

00:06:36.901 --> 00:06:39.067
and install Donald Trump
as an unelected autocrat,

00:06:39.067 --> 00:06:41.434
or the fact that one of them
apparently got caught

00:06:41.434 --> 00:06:43.434
flushing a toilet
during an oral argument

00:06:43.434 --> 00:06:44.767
conducted via telephone?

00:06:44.767 --> 00:06:46.267
-And what the FCC has said

00:06:46.267 --> 00:06:47.701
is that when...
[ Toilet flushes ]

00:06:47.701 --> 00:06:50.367
...the subject matter of a call
ranges to such topics,

00:06:50.367 --> 00:06:53.033
then the call is transformed.

00:06:53.033 --> 00:06:55.467
-Can you imagine how jarring
that must have been

00:06:55.467 --> 00:06:58.133
for the lawyers in
the middle of their arguments?

00:06:58.133 --> 00:07:00.367
I mean, it would definitely
throw me if out of nowhere

00:07:00.367 --> 00:07:02.534
I heard a toilet flush
off-camera.

00:07:02.534 --> 00:07:04.434
[ Toilet flushes ]

00:07:06.434 --> 00:07:08.634
Who was that?

00:07:08.634 --> 00:07:10.801
-Sorry, Seth.

00:07:10.801 --> 00:07:12.667
-Wally, did you go
to the bathroom

00:07:12.667 --> 00:07:14.334
during "A Closer Look"?

00:07:14.334 --> 00:07:15.801
-Yeah. You were just
on one of your rants.

00:07:15.801 --> 00:07:17.801
-Alright, you know...
[ Laughter ]

00:07:17.801 --> 00:07:19.801
The point is, we don't know
if this ruling

00:07:19.801 --> 00:07:22.334
will change at all
before it's published, or how.

00:07:22.334 --> 00:07:25.067
But what we do know is
that this is the culmination

00:07:25.067 --> 00:07:27.234
of a decades-long effort
by conservatives

00:07:27.234 --> 00:07:29.234
to turn the court
into a political weapon

00:07:29.234 --> 00:07:31.701
and aim it straight
at abortion rights.

00:07:31.701 --> 00:07:34.267
They've been plotting this
out in the open for decades.

00:07:34.267 --> 00:07:35.868
As early as 1989,

00:07:35.868 --> 00:07:38.701
there were four conservative
justices on the court

00:07:38.701 --> 00:07:41.400
who made it clear that they were
ready to overturn Roe

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:44.133
and essentially invited
anti-choice activists

00:07:44.133 --> 00:07:47.267
to help them by proposing
new restrictions on abortion.

00:07:47.267 --> 00:07:50.434
-From almost day one
after Roe was decided

00:07:50.434 --> 00:07:54.033
by the Supreme Court,
legislators who opposed abortion

00:07:54.033 --> 00:07:56.634
came in and tried
to pass restrictions.

00:07:56.634 --> 00:08:00.934
-In 1989, a Supreme Court
decision known as Webster

00:08:00.934 --> 00:08:03.434
gave the pro-life movement
a boost

00:08:03.434 --> 00:08:05.200
when four justices indicated

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:09.868
they were ready to consider
overturning Roe v. Wade.

00:08:09.868 --> 00:08:13.000
-What Webster did
is it emboldened

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.000
those who wanted
to push the question.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.133
And it said to them,
"Okay. It's alright.

00:08:19.133 --> 00:08:21.901
There's four votes here
on this court to overrule Roe.

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:25.334
We can pass bans on abortion.
Let's do that

00:08:25.334 --> 00:08:28.200
and get the question
directly before the court."

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:31.033
-That was 1989.
You know how long ago that was?

00:08:31.033 --> 00:08:34.634
Just to give you an idea, here's
what I looked like in 1989.

00:08:34.634 --> 00:08:36.968
[ Laughter ]

00:08:36.968 --> 00:08:38.968
This is what
the conservative movement,

00:08:38.968 --> 00:08:40.968
a radical minority
deeply at odds

00:08:40.968 --> 00:08:42.334
with the vast majority
of voters,

00:08:42.334 --> 00:08:44.033
has been working towards
for 50 years.

00:08:44.033 --> 00:08:46.434
And that's why they made
their Faustian bargain

00:08:46.434 --> 00:08:49.033
with an obviously monstrous
individual in Donald Trump,

00:08:49.033 --> 00:08:50.667
so they could finally cement
that majority.

00:08:50.667 --> 00:08:52.901
To them, he was just
the final piece,

00:08:52.901 --> 00:08:54.901
the culmination of a scheme

00:08:54.901 --> 00:08:57.567
that had been out in the open
since at least the Reagan era.

00:08:57.567 --> 00:08:58.934
It's why they stood with him

00:08:58.934 --> 00:09:01.367
through all his many
deprivations and indignities

00:09:01.367 --> 00:09:03.767
and numbed themselves
to his many crimes and abuses,

00:09:03.767 --> 00:09:06.400
so they could finally
achieve this outcome

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.167
they've been working toward
for half a century.

00:09:08.167 --> 00:09:10.234
In fact, Trump made
the bargain explicit.

00:09:10.234 --> 00:09:13.400
He repeatedly told Republicans
they had to vote for him

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.734
even if they didn't like him

00:09:14.734 --> 00:09:16.667
in order to get
the judges they wanted.

00:09:16.667 --> 00:09:19.334
-If you really like
Donald Trump, that's great.

00:09:19.334 --> 00:09:21.133
But if you don't,
you have to vote for me anyway.

00:09:21.133 --> 00:09:24.701
You know why?
Supreme Court judges.

00:09:24.701 --> 00:09:27.367
Supreme Court judges.

00:09:27.367 --> 00:09:30.033
Have no choice.
Sorry, sorry.

00:09:30.033 --> 00:09:31.534
[ Chuckles ]

00:09:31.534 --> 00:09:34.367
Sorry. You have no choice.

00:09:34.367 --> 00:09:38.868
-He sounds like the only kid
on your block who has a pool.

00:09:38.868 --> 00:09:40.834
"Sorry, but if you want
to use the pool,

00:09:40.834 --> 00:09:43.601
you got to be friends with me.
Sorry! Sorry.

00:09:43.601 --> 00:09:46.300
And I'm hearing it's gonna
be 88 and sunny all week long,

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:47.801
so..."

00:09:47.801 --> 00:09:48.968
[ Laughter ]

00:09:48.968 --> 00:09:51.300
Trump ripped the mask off
the Republican Party

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.601
because there were times
when Republicans and leaders

00:09:53.601 --> 00:09:56.701
of the religious right tried
to play coy, lying to us about

00:09:56.701 --> 00:09:59.367
what they were actually up to
and insisting ludicrously

00:09:59.367 --> 00:10:02.033
that they weren't really going
to outlaw abortion.

00:10:02.033 --> 00:10:03.534
They know it's deeply unpopular

00:10:03.534 --> 00:10:05.767
and far outside the mainstream
of public opinion.

00:10:05.767 --> 00:10:09.901
An NPR poll in 2019 found
that only 13% of Americans

00:10:09.901 --> 00:10:11.234
supported overturning Roe.

00:10:11.234 --> 00:10:12.567
13%.

00:10:12.567 --> 00:10:14.734
For context, the movie "Gigli"

00:10:14.734 --> 00:10:17.634
has a 13% audience rating
on Rotten Tomatoes.

00:10:17.634 --> 00:10:19.000
I love that movie.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:22.000
It's not good, but anytime
my wife and I hit a rough patch,

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.467
we lock eyes and say,

00:10:23.467 --> 00:10:26.467
"If they can get over that..."

00:10:26.467 --> 00:10:29.467
So, they knew this is
a massively unpopular move,

00:10:29.467 --> 00:10:31.567
which is why even as they
plotted out in the open

00:10:31.567 --> 00:10:33.000
for years to overturn Roe,

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.968
they also insisted to us
that we were ridiculous

00:10:35.968 --> 00:10:37.634
for thinking abortion rights
were at stake.

00:10:37.634 --> 00:10:40.767
It's why Kavanaugh and
Neil Gorsuch lied to the Senate,

00:10:40.767 --> 00:10:44.267
or why the co-chair of Trump's
evangelical advisory board

00:10:44.267 --> 00:10:46.901
said in 2018, "The left
is going to try very hard

00:10:46.901 --> 00:10:49.300
to say this is all about
overturning Roe."

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:51.133
But Trump threw all that
out the window,

00:10:51.133 --> 00:10:53.000
when, in a craven bid to grovel

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.701
for the support
of the religious right,

00:10:54.701 --> 00:10:57.734
he just came out and said
he would appoint pro-life judges

00:10:57.734 --> 00:10:59.067
who would overturn Roe.

00:10:59.067 --> 00:11:01.300
-Do you want to see
the court overturn Roe v. Wade?

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:05.100
-Well, if we put another two
or perhaps three justices on,

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:08.033
that's really what's going
to be -- that will happen.

00:11:08.033 --> 00:11:10.367
And that'll happen
automatically, in my opinion,

00:11:10.367 --> 00:11:13.701
because I am putting pro-life
justices on the court.

00:11:13.701 --> 00:11:15.701
Having to do with abortion,
when it --

00:11:15.701 --> 00:11:19.334
if it ever were overturned,
it would go back to the states.

00:11:19.334 --> 00:11:21.000
So, it would go back
to the states.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.834
-But then some women won't
be able to get an abortion.

00:11:22.834 --> 00:11:24.100
-No, it'll go back
to the states.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:25.367
-By state -- no, some...

00:11:25.367 --> 00:11:27.467
-Well, they'll perhaps
have to go to another --

00:11:27.467 --> 00:11:30.100
they'll have to go
to another state.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.767
-And that's okay?
-Well, we'll see what happens.

00:11:32.767 --> 00:11:36.133
-He's so cavalier about a woman
needing to cross state lines

00:11:36.133 --> 00:11:37.767
for access
to lifesaving healthcare.

00:11:37.767 --> 00:11:40.000
It's maddening when someone
who loses his [bleep]

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.834
over even the smallest slights

00:11:41.834 --> 00:11:44.033
tells you the thing you're
worried about is no big deal.

00:11:44.033 --> 00:11:45.501
Remember, this is a guy who,

00:11:45.501 --> 00:11:48.601
if a restaurant didn't have
the right ketchup for his steak,

00:11:48.601 --> 00:11:51.367
would bitch about it at rallies
for the next year and a half.

00:11:51.367 --> 00:11:53.067
[ As Trump ] They said,
"We're sorry, Mr. Trump.

00:11:53.067 --> 00:11:54.901
We don't have Heinz.
We only have Hunt's."

00:11:54.901 --> 00:11:57.601
And I said, "Hunt's?
That's not a real ketchup."

00:11:57.601 --> 00:12:00.167
We know that about Hunt's.
I hate to say it, but it's not.

00:12:00.167 --> 00:12:03.400
We love Heinz.
Don't we love Heinz?

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:05.067
[ Normal voice]
Trump ripped the mask off

00:12:05.067 --> 00:12:06.701
the entire corrupt enterprise

00:12:06.701 --> 00:12:08.601
and just laid out
the devil's bargain

00:12:08.601 --> 00:12:10.300
he made with the GOP,
for all to see.

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:13.634
He even said explicitly the list
of judges would be chosen

00:12:13.634 --> 00:12:15.501
by the conservative
Federalist Society.

00:12:15.501 --> 00:12:17.367
I doubt he even read that list.

00:12:17.367 --> 00:12:19.000
He probably just
picked a name off it

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:22.734
the way your aunt orders
a fun cocktail on vacation.

00:12:22.734 --> 00:12:28.234
"Oh, a Horny Caterpillar.
Don't mind if I do."

00:12:28.234 --> 00:12:30.400
Which is why
it's all the more grotesque

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:32.934
and absurd for Republicans
who supported nominees

00:12:32.934 --> 00:12:34.734
like Neil Gorsuch
or Brett Kavanaugh

00:12:34.734 --> 00:12:36.567
to suddenly claim now

00:12:36.567 --> 00:12:38.267
that they're shocked
by what's happening.

00:12:38.267 --> 00:12:41.067
-Today, Senator Collins
reacted to the news

00:12:41.067 --> 00:12:42.934
with a brief statement
saying in part, quote,

00:12:42.934 --> 00:12:46.267
"If this leaked draft opinion
is the final decision

00:12:46.267 --> 00:12:48.334
and this reporting is accurate,
it would be

00:12:48.334 --> 00:12:50.734
completely inconsistent
with what Justice Gorsuch

00:12:50.734 --> 00:12:52.734
and Justice Kavanaugh
said in their hearings

00:12:52.734 --> 00:12:55.534
and in our meetings
in my office," unquote.

00:12:55.534 --> 00:12:57.367
Senator Murkowski today, too,

00:12:57.367 --> 00:12:59.634
also suggested that
Gorsuch and Kavanaugh

00:12:59.634 --> 00:13:02.367
perhaps had not been fully
honest about their positions.

00:13:02.367 --> 00:13:04.868
-If it goes in the direction

00:13:04.868 --> 00:13:10.400
that this leaked copy
has indicated,

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:14.200
I will just tell you
that it -- it...

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:18.033
it rocks my confidence
in the court right now.

00:13:18.033 --> 00:13:20.601
-I'm sorry, THIS rocks
her confidence in the court?

00:13:20.601 --> 00:13:22.701
And when you found out
the tooth fairy wasn't real,

00:13:22.701 --> 00:13:24.701
did that rock your confidence
in dentistry?

00:13:24.701 --> 00:13:25.934
"Wait a second,

00:13:25.934 --> 00:13:27.934
then where the hell have
all my teeth been going?!"

00:13:27.934 --> 00:13:29.868
I for one don't believe
they're this gullible.

00:13:29.868 --> 00:13:31.501
I think they knew
it would come to this

00:13:31.501 --> 00:13:33.000
and now they want
to feign surprise,

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.033
because for all their talk
about snowflakes,

00:13:35.033 --> 00:13:37.367
Republicans take the cake
every time.

00:13:37.367 --> 00:13:38.901
"You were mean to my friend

00:13:38.901 --> 00:13:40.834
who was applying
for a lifetime appointment."

00:13:40.834 --> 00:13:42.300
"You leaked a document

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.467
that rolled back women's rights
half a century."

00:13:44.467 --> 00:13:47.501
"How were we supposed to know
a thing that was going to happen

00:13:47.501 --> 00:13:49.567
that everyone said
was going to happen?"

00:13:49.567 --> 00:13:52.133
"Why does it smell
like guacamole in here?"

00:13:52.133 --> 00:13:53.901
Republicans have been playing
the long game

00:13:53.901 --> 00:13:55.334
and plotting this for decades.

00:13:55.334 --> 00:13:58.033
The only way to combat them
is to take the fight head-on,

00:13:58.033 --> 00:14:00.667
to enshrine a woman's right
to choose in federal law,

00:14:00.667 --> 00:14:02.234
stand up
for the majority of Americans

00:14:02.234 --> 00:14:03.834
who oppose this
extremist ruling,

00:14:03.834 --> 00:14:05.734
and make it an issue
Republicans can't dodge.

00:14:05.734 --> 00:14:07.267
We can't just
sit around and hope

00:14:07.267 --> 00:14:09.968
Alito will take his draft
opinion and do this to it.

00:14:09.968 --> 00:14:11.667
-...the subject matter
of a call...

00:14:11.667 --> 00:14:13.834
[ Toilet flushes ]
...ranges to such topics...

00:14:13.834 --> 00:14:16.000
-This has been "A Closer Look."

